<div class="mb-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Cost</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">
    Real provider calls per 100 runs, by day. A cache hit or a rule-auto-settled gate
    makes no call at all, so a falling trend here is the cost-reduction features working.
  </p>
</div>

<% if @daily_stats.any? %>
  <%= render "chart", daily_stats: @daily_stats %>
  <%= render "table", daily_stats: @daily_stats %>
<% else %>
  <div class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white px-6 py-12 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">No runs yet.</p>
  </div>
<% end %>
